# Xcode
#
# gitignore contributors: remember to update Global/Xcode.gitignore, Global/macOS.gitignore too!

## User settings
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

## Build generated
build/
DerivedData/
*.moved-aside
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3

## Various settings
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint

## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/

## CocoaPods (in case added later)
Pods/

## macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

## Secrets — never commit API keys (TMDB, AI, etc.)
Secrets.xcconfig
*.env
